msgid "Add this character in the corptools Character Audit."
msgstr "请在 corptools Character 审计中添加此 Character。"

#: checks.py:113
msgid "Scopes missing"
msgstr "缺少 Scope"

#: checks.py:114
msgid "None of the character's tokens carries all scopes corptools asks for."
msgstr "该 Character 的令牌中没有一个包含 corptools 所需的全部 Scope。"

#: checks.py:116
msgid ""
"The player adds this character in the corptools Character Audit again and "
"grants every scope it asks for."
msgstr "玩家在 corptools Character 审计中重新添加此 Character，并授予其要求的全部 Scope。"

#: checks.py:121
msgid ""
"The player ticks Character Audit in CharLink, logs in with this character "
"again and grants every scope it asks for."
msgstr "玩家在 CharLink 中勾选 Character Audit，重新用此 Character 登录，并授予其要求的全部 Scope。"

#: checks.py:125
msgid ""
"Tick Character Audit in CharLink, log in with this character again and grant"
" every scope it asks for."
msgstr "请在 CharLink 中勾选 Character Audit，重新用此 Character 登录，并授予其要求的全部 Scope。"

#: checks.py:129
msgid ""
"Add this character in the corptools Character Audit again and grant every "
"scope it asks for."
msgstr "请在 corptools Character 审计中重新添加此 Character，并授予其要求的全部 Scope。"

#: checks.py:137
msgid "Audit inactive"
msgstr "审计未激活"

#: checks.py:138
msgid ""
"corptools marks the audit inactive: a section has not updated for too long."
msgstr "corptools 将该审计标记为未激活：某个部分太久没有更新。"

#: checks.py:139
msgid ""
"The next corptools update usually clears this; if it stays, the player adds "
"the character again."
msgstr "通常下一次 corptools 更新后即可恢复；如果仍然存在，玩家需重新添加该 Character。"

#: checks.py:142
msgid ""
"The next corptools update usually clears this; if it stays, the player ticks"
" Character Audit in CharLink and logs in with this character again."
msgstr ""
"通常下一次 corptools 更新后即可恢复；如果仍然存在，玩家需在 CharLink 中勾选 Character Audit 并重新用此 "
"Character 登录。"

#: checks.py:146
msgid ""
"The next corptools update usually clears this; if it stays, tick Character "
"Audit in CharLink and log in with this character again."
msgstr ""
"通常下一次 corptools 更新后即可恢复；如果仍然存在，请在 CharLink 中勾选 Character Audit 并重新用此 "
"Character 登录。"

#: checks.py:149
msgid ""
"The next corptools update usually clears this; if it stays, add the "
"character again."
msgstr "通常下一次 corptools 更新后即可恢复；如果仍然存在，请重新添加该 Character。"

#: checks.py:155
msgid "Director token missing"
msgstr "缺少 Director 令牌"

#: checks.py:157
msgid ""
"The character is a Director of its Corporation, but none of its tokens "
"carries all scopes corptools needs for the Corporation audit."
msgstr ""
"该 Character 是其 Corporation 的 Director，但其令牌中没有一个包含 corptools 进行 Corporation "
"审计所需的全部 Scope。"

#: checks.py:161
msgid ""
"The Director clicks Add Token in the corptools Corporation Audit, ticks "
"every box and logs in with this character."
msgstr ""
"该 Director 在 corptools Corporation 审计中点击 Add Token，勾选所有选项，并用此 Character 登录。"

#: checks.py:168
msgid ""
"The Director ticks Corporation Audit (Full) in CharLink and logs in with "
"this character."
msgstr "该 Director 在 CharLink 中勾选 Corporation Audit (Full)，并用此 Character 登录。"

#: checks.py:170
msgid ""
"Tick Corporation Audit (Full) in CharLink and log in with this character."
msgstr "请在 CharLink 中勾选 Corporation Audit (Full)，并用此 Character 登录。"

#: checks.py:172
msgid ""
"Click Add Token in the corptools Corporation Audit, tick every box and log "
"in with this character."
msgstr "请在 corptools Corporation 审计中点击 Add Token，勾选所有选项，并用此 Character 登录。"

#: checks.py:180
msgid "Corporation audit missing"
msgstr "缺少 Corporation 审计"

#: checks.py:181
msgid "The Corporation has no corptools Corporation Audit."
msgstr "该 Corporation 没有 corptools Corporation 审计。"

#: checks.py:182
msgid "A Director adds the Corporation in the corptools Corporation Audit."
msgstr "由一名 Director 在 corptools Corporation 审计中添加该 Corporation。"

#: checks.py:184 checks.py:194
msgid ""
"A Director ticks Corporation Audit in CharLink and logs in with the Director"
" character."
msgstr ""
"由一名 Director 在 CharLink 中勾选 Corporation Audit，并用该 Director 的 Character 登录。"

#: checks.py:190
msgid "Corporation token missing"
msgstr "缺少 Corporation 令牌"

#: checks.py:191
msgid ""
"No character of the Corporation has a token with the scopes the Corporation "
"audit needs."
msgstr "该 Corporation 没有任何 Character 拥有 Corporation 审计所需 Scope 的令牌。"

#: checks.py:192
msgid ""
"A Director adds a Corporation token in the corptools Corporation Audit."
msgstr "由一名 Director 在 corptools Corporation 审计中添加 Corporation 令牌。"

#: checks.py:200
msgid "Corporation data stale"
msgstr "Corporation 数据已过期"

#: checks.py:201
msgid "A section of the Corporation audit has not updated within the limit."
msgstr "Corporation 审计的某个部分未在期限内更新。"

#: checks.py:203
msgid ""
"A Director checks the Corporation token in the corptools Corporation Audit "
"and adds a new one if it lost its roles."
msgstr ""
"由一名 Director 在 corptools Corporation 审计中检查 Corporation 令牌，如其已失去角色则添加新令牌。"

#: checks.py:208
msgid ""
"A Director ticks Corporation Audit in CharLink and logs in again with the "
"Director character; the old token may have lost its roles."
msgstr ""
"由一名 Director 在 CharLink 中勾选 Corporation Audit，并重新用该 Director 的 Character "
"登录；旧令牌可能已失去其角色。"

#: checks.py:216
msgid "No structure owner"
msgstr "没有建筑所有者"

#: checks.py:217
msgid "The Corporation is not set up as an owner in aa-structures."
msgstr "该 Corporation 未在 aa-structures 中设置为所有者。"

#: checks.py:218
msgid ""
"A character with the Station Manager role adds the Corporation as an owner "
"in aa-structures."
msgstr ""
"由拥有 Station Manager 角色的 Character 在 aa-structures 中将该 Corporation 添加为所有者。"

#: checks.py:220 checks.py:238
msgid ""
"A character with the Station Manager role ticks Structures in CharLink and "
"logs in."
msgstr "由拥有 Station Manager 角色的 Character 在 CharLink 中勾选 Structures 并登录。"

#: checks.py:226
msgid "Structure owner inactive"
msgstr "建筑所有者未启用"

#: checks.py:227
msgid "The aa-structures owner of the Corporation is switched off."
msgstr "该 Corporation 的 aa-structures 所有者已被关闭。"

#: checks.py:228
msgid "An admin switches the owner on again in the aa-structures admin."
msgstr "由管理员在 aa-structures 管理后台重新启用该所有者。"

#: checks.py:234
msgid "No structure owner character"
msgstr "没有建筑所有者 Character"

#: checks.py:235
msgid ""
"The aa-structures owner has no enabled character left to fetch data with."
msgstr "该 aa-structures 所有者没有剩余的已启用 Character 可用于获取数据。"

#: checks.py:236
msgid ""
"A character with the Station Manager role adds itself to the owner in aa-"
"structures."
msgstr "由拥有 Station Manager 角色的 Character 在 aa-structures 中将自己添加到该所有者。"

#: checks.py:244
msgid "Structure sync failing"
msgstr "建筑同步失败"

#: checks.py:245
msgid "aa-structures reports a sync that is not up to date."
msgstr "aa-structures 报告有同步未保持最新。"

#: checks.py:246
msgid ""
"Check the owner in aa-structures: its characters may have lost the Station "
"Manager role."
msgstr "请在 aa-structures 中检查该所有者：其 Character 可能已失去 Station Manager 角色。"

#: checks.py:249
msgid ""
"A character with the Station Manager role ticks Structures in CharLink and "
"logs in again; the owner's characters may have lost the role."
msgstr ""
"由拥有 Station Manager 角色的 Character 在 CharLink 中勾选 Structures 并重新登录；该所有者的 "
"Character 可能已失去该角色。"

